msgstr "已登录，并导入了订阅「%s」"

msgid "Log In"
msgstr "登录"

msgid "Panel Account"
msgstr "主控账户"

msgid "On the panel website, open \"Scan to log in\" and click \"Copy login link\", then paste it here. The link works once, within 5 minutes."
msgstr "在主控网页打开「扫码登录」，点「复制登录链接」，粘贴到这里。链接只能用一次，5 分钟内有效。"

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "刷新"

msgid "Log Out"
msgstr "退出登录"

msgid "Log out? Subscriptions imported from this panel will be removed from the router."
msgstr "确定退出登录？从这个主控导入的订阅会从路由器上删除。"

msgid "Account subscriptions…"
msgstr "正在获取账户订阅…"

msgid "Account subscriptions · not downloaded"
msgstr "账户订阅 · 未下载"

msgid "Failed to load: %s"
msgstr "加载失败：%s"

msgid "Retry"
msgstr "重试"

msgid "po0 Whitelist"
msgstr "po0 加白"

msgid "Report the router's public IP to po0 servers (registered on the panel and added by you), every 10 minutes and whenever WAN reconnects. Traffic to these po0 servers goes direct."
msgstr "把路由器的出口 IP 上报到 po0 服务器（主控登记的与自己添加的），每 10 分钟及 WAN 重新拨号时自动加白；访问这些 po0 的流量一律直连。"

msgid "Registered on the panel (%d)"
msgstr "主控登记（%d）"

msgid "Log in to the panel account to fetch them automatically."
msgstr "登录主控账户后自动获取。"

msgid "No po0 servers for this account."
msgstr "这个账户下没有 po0 服务器。"

msgid "Custom po0 servers (%d)"
msgstr "自定义 po0 服务器（%d）"

msgid "\"po0 Whitelist\" is off, so these servers are not reported for now."
msgstr "「po0 加白」开关关着，添加的服务器暂不上报。"

msgid "Address: IP or domain, port optional"
msgstr "地址：IP 或域名，可带端口"

msgid "Token, starts with pgnfw_ (@slot optional)"
msgstr "token，pgnfw_ 开头（可带 @槽位）"

msgid "Enter the po0 server address"
msgstr "请填写 po0 服务器地址"

msgid "The token should be the whole string starting with pgnfw_, @slot optional"
msgstr "token 不对：应为 pgnfw_ 开头的那一整串，可带 @槽位"

msgid "Fill in the po0 server's IP or domain, port optional, e.g. 1.2.3.4 or fw.example.com:8443; copy the token from the po0 dashboard."
msgstr "地址填 po0 服务器的 IP 或域名，可带端口，如 1.2.3.4 或 fw.example.com:8443；token 在 po0 后台复制。"

msgid "Operation failed"
msgstr "操作失败"

msgid "Extras"
msgstr "辅助功能"

msgid "About"
msgstr "关于"

msgid "Plugin %s · Core %s"
msgstr "插件 %s · 内核 %s"

msgid "Open Source"
msgstr "开源"

msgid "This project is open source under the GPL-3.0 license. Source code, issues and release notes are on GitHub:"
msgstr "本项目以 GPL-3.0 协议开源，源码、问题反馈与更新记录都在 GitHub："

msgid "View on GitHub"
msgstr "在 GitHub 上查看"

msgid "Acknowledgements"
msgstr "致谢"

msgid "MeowX for OpenWrt is built on %s. Its transparent proxy, mixin and service scripts all come from it. Many thanks to the nikki project and its authors."
msgstr "MeowX OpenWrt 版基于 %s 改造，透明代理、配置混入与服务脚本都来自它。衷心感谢 nikki 项目及其作者。"

msgid "The core is the MeowX fork of %s (source in %s), adding protocols such as Miu that upstream mihomo does not have."
msgstr "内核是 %s 的 MeowX 分支（源码在 %s），加入了 Miu 等官方 mihomo 没有的协议。"

msgid "Checking for updates…"
msgstr "正在检查更新…"

msgid "Unable to check for updates"
msgstr "检查更新失败"

msgid "You are on the latest version"
msgstr "已是最新版本"

msgid "New version %s available"
msgstr "有新版本 %s"

msgid "Update to %s"
msgstr "更新到 %s"

msgid "Update MeowX to %s? The page may be briefly unavailable while it installs; settings and subscriptions are kept."
msgstr "更新 MeowX 到 %s？安装期间页面可能短暂打不开，设置与订阅都会保留。"

msgid "Updated to %s, reloading the page…"
msgstr "已更新到 %s，正在刷新页面…"

msgid "No output"
msgstr "没有输出"

msgid "The core is not running, so the web dashboard cannot be updated. Start the service first."
msgstr "内核没有运行，无法更新 Web 面板，请先启动服务。"

msgid "Web dashboard updated"
msgstr "Web 面板已更新"

msgid "Failed to update the web dashboard: %s"
msgstr "Web 面板更新失败：%s"

msgid "no response from the core"
msgstr "内核没有响应"

msgid "Subscriptions in your panel account"
msgstr "账户下的订阅"

msgid "Import"
msgstr "导入"

msgid "The running config has no external controller, so the web dashboard is unavailable. Turn off \"Core Only\" (the mixin adds it) or add external-controller to the profile, then reload the service."
msgstr "当前运行的配置里没有外部控制端口，Web 面板用不了：关掉「仅核心」（混入配置时会加上），或在配置里写上 external-controller，然后重载服务。"

msgid "The core is not running. Choose a subscription and start the service first."
msgstr "内核没有运行：先在订阅卡选好订阅并启动服务。"
